<title>GERMANY: Waigel's CSU approves 3 pct EMU deficit.</title>
<headline>Waigel's CSU approves 3 pct EMU deficit.</headline>
<dateline>FUERTH, Germany 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Fiance Minister Theo Waigel's Christian Social Union on Friday approved an extremely strict interpretation of the EMU deficit criteria, saying it must be 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>At a party meeting the delegates unanimously approved a motion that the three percent budget deficit criterion in the Maastricht treaty would mean 3.0 percent.</p>
</text>
